<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pădus</span></b> , i, m.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the Po</i>,
				<i>the principal river of Italy</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 5,
				33, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 4, 4 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 16,
				20, § 117</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sive Padi ripis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 9, 680</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">populiferque Padus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 17, 32</span></i>
			. —Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pădānĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>on the Po</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 33</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pădā-nus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to the Po</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">culices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 1, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
